.SH NAME

freq2pin \- Tormach Frequency to Pin Component
.SH SYNOPSIS
.HP
.B loadrt freq2pin [count=\fIN\fB|names=\fIname1\fB[,\fIname2...\fB]] [personality=\fIP,P,...\fB]
.SH FUNCTIONS
.TP
\fBfreq2pin.\fIN\fB\fR (requires a floating-point thread)
Decodes frequency input to bitmap pin output.
.SH PINS
.TP
.B freq2pin.\fIN\fB.input\fR float in \fR
.TQ
.B freq2pin.\fIN\fB.output-\fIM\fB\fR bit io  (M=0..personality) \fR
.TQ
.B freq2pin.\fIN\fB.output-not-\fIM\fB\fR bit io  (M=0..personality) \fR
.SH PARAMETERS
.TP
.B freq2pin.\fIN\fB.freq-width\fR u32 rw \fR
.TQ
.B freq2pin.\fIN\fB.stability-count\fR u32 rw \fR
.TQ
.B freq2pin.\fIN\fB.stability-width\fR u32 rw \fR
.TQ
.B freq2pin.\fIN\fB.freq-table-\fIMM\fB\fR u32 rw  (MM=00..( personality * personality )) \fR
